abstract: >-
  Source code accompanying Sylow synchronization in finite groups:
  The good case, by Hong Yi Huang, Francesca Lisi, Aluna Rizzoli and
  Luca Sabatini. Includes Lean formalizations, standalone Magma checks
  for Section 3, exact finite certificates, pinned dependencies, and
  verification records. Vendored code retains its upstream license
  and attribution.
